{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             ﻿\n \n \n \n \n \n ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます。櫻坂46の関有美子です🐱\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZVDJYXHGXYCY45JB273XD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 桜を見ることができました🌸\n 桜の木の下を通るたびに風に吹かれた花びらが舞っていてきれいだなーっと思う反面、散ってしまっているのかなと悲しくなります。\n \n また来年元気で会おうね！桜さん☺︎\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZVF190JC1DNWZWNSM3F4V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n カメラでも撮ったので、近々カメラ屋さんに行ってブログかメッセージでおくります☺︎\n \n \n \n \n \n 新しいアー写と集合でのアー写の写真を載せよう！と思ったのですが、ほとんど井上との写真でした🦒\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZVGNMZ77PB8DN94HDSEWF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZVHTK81SKAHDBZ67SCG3C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZVMAF5E26Z1FRDKCZ7NG0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n この衣装は布を巻き付けているのですが\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZVPC6W18Z0ZA8JGBGPEFY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n くるくる巻いてバラをつくりました🌹\n \n \n \n 井上に見てー！バラー！って言ったら、もっとこうしよう！って手伝ってくれた写真がこちら\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZVR3TJ1HS29R8PXHZ2GAQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 可愛いなあ☺︎\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZVSP1MBM85B2CMFM1Q26V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZVV4E5W54SFQ54Z6HVBFX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZVWTD0CVCCA768N2E7ME4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n そこさくも新制服になるので楽しみにしていてください☺︎\n \n \n \n \n \n #ゆみこそんぐ\n BUMP OF CHICKENさんの